select slug, status, scheduled_at at time zone 'America/Boise' as boise from public.social_enqueue($q$2026-10-30-arm-pump$q$, $q$image$q$, $q$Arm pump gets treated like a fitness problem. A lot of the time it's a harsh front end: the fork isn't absorbing the chatter, so you squeeze the bars to survive it, and your forearms are full by lap three.

Before the gym fixes it, try the free stuff. A click or two out on fork compression. Check your sag. Make sure rebound isn't packing the fork down through the braking bumps.

